  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/22/Garden_Tent.png/revision/latest?cb=20250318010935\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Garden Tent\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Garden Tent\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/22/Garden_Tent.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20250318010935\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"253\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Garden Tent</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/decorations-6168\" title=\"Decorations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">decoration</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 1</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2×2</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/ea/Diamond.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312154318\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 999</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Garden Tent</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/decorations-6168\" title=\"Decorations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">decoration</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 1. You can place it on the <a href=\"/wiki/farm-15139\" title=\"Farm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">farm</a>, in the <a href=\"/wiki/town-13129\" title=\"Town\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">town</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/sanctuary-28458\" title=\"Sanctuary\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">sanctuary</a>.\n</p><p>Like all <a href=\"/wiki/decorations-6168\" title=\"Decorations\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">decorations</a>, it is stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">shop</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span></span><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>How to get?</b></span></h3>\n<p>You was able to get it:\n</p>\n<ul><li>in <a href=\"/wiki/farm-pass-34637\" title=\"Farm Pass\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Farm Pass</a>, 4 season</li>\n<li>for watching ads <a href=\"/wiki/movie-ticket-16890\" title=\"Movie Ticket\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Night at the Movie</a></li>\n<li>buy in <span class=\"new\" title=\"Currency Shop (page does not exist)\">Currency Shop</span> for action in March 2020 (for real money)</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831004616\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 905/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1436/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 364/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 639573/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.319      1 -total\n 77.51%   34.353      1 Template:Infobox\n 34.81%   15.429      2 Template:Infoicon\n 11.86%    5.257      1 Template:Navigation\n  4.19%    1.859      1 Template:Languages\n  2.87%    1.272      2 Template:Clr\n  2.71%    1.199      1 Template:PageDisplay\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:36295-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260831004616 and revision id 108204. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
